	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Markdown Cheatsheet

Press ⌃⌥M anywhere (or type `md` in Alfred) to pop up a rendered Markdown syntax cheatsheet. Esc closes it; ⌘↩ opens the cheatsheet file so you can edit it.

By default the copy of `cheatsheet.md` bundled in this workflow is shown. To use your own file (e.g. a clone of the repo), set **Cheatsheet file** in the Configure panel.

An Alfred port of Aaron Schiff's Hammerspoon + pandoc md-cheatsheet (https://github.com/aaronschiff/md-cheatsheet) — the cheatsheet content is his.

Requires Alfred 5.5 or later (Text View).</string>
